{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 12 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪与图像恢复：残差、盲点与长程建模的假设边界</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Denoising &amp; Restoration</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_052_dncnn-title\">DnCNN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">深 CNN 回归噪声残差，再与输入显式相减，而非直接回归 clean image。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Trains a deep plain CNN with BatchNorm and ReLU to regress the additive noise residual R_θ(y) ≈ n rather than the clean image, recovering x̂ = y − R_θ(y).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">含噪图像 y=x+n</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Noisy observation y = x + n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">去噪图像 x_hat=y-R_theta(y)</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Denoised image estimate x̂ = y − R_θ(y)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28166495/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_052_dncnn')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_052_dncnn')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DnCNN original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/f921bf2e7a1d26a9b448.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_052_dncnn\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_052_dncnn')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_052_dncnn\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">含噪图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Noisy Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">原论文主要建模加性白高斯噪声</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests noisy observation y = x + n and prepares initial tensor representations (Noisy Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"原论文主要建模加性白高斯噪声\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests noisy observation y = x + n and prepares initial tensor representations (Noisy Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"含噪图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Noisy Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">含噪图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Noisy Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">原论文主要建模加性白高斯噪声</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests noisy observation y = x + n and prepares initial tensor representations (Noisy Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"首层从 y 提取浅层局部噪声/纹理特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Conv+ReLU to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Conv+ReLU\" data-node-name-en=\"Conv+ReLU\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Conv+ReLU</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">首层从 y 提取浅层局部噪声/纹理特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Conv+ReLU to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多层 3×3 Conv+BN+ReLU 扩大感受野\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs convolution within the core residual noise cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"深卷积栈\" data-node-name-en=\"convolution\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">深卷积栈</span><span class=\"lang-en\">convolution</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多层 3×3 Conv+BN+ReLU 扩大感受野</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs convolution within the core residual noise cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"末层回归与图像同尺寸的噪声残差\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Conv within the core residual noise cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"线性 Conv\" data-node-name-en=\"Conv\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">线性 Conv</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">末层回归与图像同尺寸的噪声残差</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Conv within the core residual noise cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"R_theta(y) 逼近噪声而非直接复制干净图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs n_hat within the core residual noise cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"n_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"n_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>n_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">R_theta(y) 逼近噪声而非直接复制干净图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs n_hat within the core residual noise cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"x_hat=y-n_hat，保留显式 identity path\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Residual Subtraction to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"残差相减\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual Subtraction\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">残差相减</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Residual Subtraction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x_hat=y-n_hat，保留显式 identity path</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Residual Subtraction to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"恢复后的图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces denoised image estimate x̂ = y − r_θ(y) via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_052_dncnn', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">恢复后的图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces denoised image estimate x̂ = y − r_θ(y) via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DnCNN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 噪声残差回归与输入相减</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Residual Noise Regression x̂ = y − R_θ(y) Preserving the Clean Identity Signal</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DnCNN：核心公式 · 噪声残差回归与输入相减\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"52\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"28.644132pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -67.993583 220.000982 28.644132\" width=