\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">直接回归 clean image 还需复制大部分解剖信号</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Directly mapping a noisy image to a clean image forced deep networks to re-synthesize all low-frequency anatomical structures.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">预测噪声残差 r(y)，以 xhat=y-r(y) 保留 identity path</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Predict only the zero-mean noise residual R_θ(y) so the target mapping is much closer to zero than to the identity image.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">深残差噪声学习和可扩展的 noise-level 训练</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Synergy between residual noise learning and batch normalization, supporting single-model blind Gaussian denoising across noise levels.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">广泛作为低剂量 CT、PET、X-ray 和 MRI 去噪基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Universal lightweight baseline for low-dose CT, planar X-ray, ultrasound, and MRI image-space denoising.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">基础设施级 baseline；原版 AWGN 与 BatchNorm 假设不匹配真实医学噪声</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational restoration baseline; i.i.d. AWGN assumptions fail on spatially correlated CT sinogram streaks or Poisson PET noise without domain adaptation.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">残差学习让网络集中预测相对稀疏、幅度较小的噪声分量，而输入沿 identity path 保留。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">连续 3×3 卷积在不下采样时逐层扩大感受野，保持逐像素输出。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">BatchNorm 与固定噪声训练在 AWGN 上有效，但真实医学噪声常具强度依赖和空间相关性。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Predict only the zero-mean noise residual R_θ(y) so the target mapping is much closer to zero than to the identity image.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Synergy between residual noise learning and batch normalization, supporting single-model blind Gaussian denoising across noise levels.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Residual Noise Regression x̂ = y − R_θ(y) Preserving the Clean Identity Signal.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可作为低剂量 CT、PET、X-ray 或 MRI 图像域去噪的透明基线。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">若未建模 Poisson、Rician、重建纹理或病灶稀有性，残差网络可能把低对比病灶当作噪声。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Universal lightweight baseline for low-dose CT, planar X-ray, ultrasound, and MRI image-space denoising.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Foundational restoration baseline; i.i.d. AWGN assumptions fail on spatially correlated CT sinogram streaks or Poisson PET noise without domain adaptation.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28166495/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Beyond a Gaussian Denoiser: Residual Learning of Deep CNN for Image Denoising</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/cszn/DnCNN\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
